00:01:05.474 --> 00:01:07.303
- I never keep trying what ...

00:01:07.303 --> 00:01:10.252
Like standup is always the standby for me.

00:01:10.252 --> 00:01:11.482
Like that's what I do.

00:01:11.482 --> 00:01:12.429
