00:08:07.094 --> 00:08:08.179
You (inaudible)

00:08:08.179 --> 00:08:09.076
- I wanted to make movies, yeah.

00:08:09.076 --> 00:08:10.242
Very badly.

00:08:10.242 --> 00:08:11.760
- And so the net with that
show was very popular.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.400
The studio was probably excited about it.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.233
- Sure.

00:08:15.233 --> 00:08:16.217
- You go out you shoot the thing,

00:08:16.217 --> 00:08:17.123
you write the thing,

00:08:17.123 --> 00:08:17.965
you do all of it.

00:08:17.965 --> 00:08:19.571
